anet: The Google Cluster Architecture</article-title><source>IEEE Micro</source><year>2003</year><volume>23</volume><fpage>22</fpage><lpage>28</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="B48"><citation citation-type="other"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ghemawat</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Gobioff</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Leung</surname><given-names>ST</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>The Google File System</article-title><source>Proceedings of the 19th ACM Symposium on Operating Systems Principles (SOSP 2003), Bolton Landing, New York</source><year>2003</year><fpage>29</fpage><lpage>43</lpage></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>